[I] Generate Your Projects Meta-Build system

[T] GYP (Generate Your Projects) is a Python meta build system originally
[T] developed for Chromium. It generates native build files for Make, Ninja,
[T] Xcode or Visual Studio from platform-independent .gyp project
[T] descriptions and is still used by node-gyp.

[U] https://github.com/nodejs/gyp-next

